<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 18,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Russia.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 18,000 T U.S. HRW wheat for Russia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it was seeking up to 18,000 tonnes U.S. No. 2 or better hard red winter wheat for donation under the Food for Progress program to Russia.</p>
<p>The shipment period was slated for September 10-30.</p>
<p>Offers are due on August 25, the CCC said, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
